OL,3,CFamilies forced to flee their homes
OL,4,Cafter volcano erupts in Guatemala
OL,6,FAuthorities in Guatemala have ordered
OL,7,Fevacuations after one of the country's
OL,8,Fmost active volcanos started erupting.
OL,10,FImages showed big clouds of gas and
OL,11,Fash over the volcano as lava and
OL,12,Fpyroclastic flows rolled down the
OL,13,Fslopes of the Fuego volcano at great
OL,14,Fspeed.
OL,16,FPart of the mountain range of the
OL,17,FSierra Madre, the Fuego volcano is
OL,18,Fabout 16 km west of Antigua, one of
OL,19,FGuatemala's most popular tourist
OL,20,Fdestinations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
