OL,3,CFamilies forced to flee their homes
OL,4,Cafter volcano erupts in Guatemala
OL,6,FThe eruption started on Monday morning
OL,7,Fand increased during the day, which
OL,8,Fled to evacuation orders for two
OL,9,Fvillages around the mountain,
OL,10,Faccording to Claudinne Ogaldes,
OL,11,Fexecutive secretary of the Guatemalan
OL,12,Fdisaster managing agency, CONRED.
OL,14,FA report Guatemalan Seismology,
OL,15,FVulcanology, Weather and Water
OL,16,FInstitute said: "The eruption
OL,17,Fincreases its explosiveness level. A
OL,18,Ffountain of lava of between 200 and
OL,19,F300 meters (650 to 1,000 feet) has
OL,20,Fdeveloped over the crater."
