OL,3,CFamilies forced to flee their homes
OL,4,Cafter volcano erupts in Guatemala
OL,6,FCONRED said that authorities were
OL,7,Fevacuating El Porvenir and the hamlet
OL,8,Fof Las Lajitas as a preventive measure.
OL,10,FThat would be around 50 families or
OL,11,F250 people. The agency declared an
OL,12,Forange alert and warned of ashes
OL,13,Fspreading to nearby towns.
OL,15,FA major highway that passes close to
OL,16,Fthe volcano, National Route 14, was
OL,17,Fclosed. The Education Ministry
OL,18,Fsuspended classes in nearby towns.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
