OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785857769
OL,3,CFamilies forced to flee their homes
OL,4,Cafter volcano erupts in Guatemala
OL,6,FHundreds of people were killed and a
OL,7,Fwhole village was destroyed during a
OL,8,Fprevious eruption on the Fuego volcano
OL,9,Fin June 2018.
OL,11,FThat episode affected up to 1.7
OL,12,Fmillion people, according to
OL,13,Fauthorities.
OL,15,FThe Fuego volcano is one of the most
OL,16,Factive in Guatemala. Another eruption
OL,17,Fin June last year spurred preventive
OL,18,Fevacuations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/4
